      "numbered_text": "1: ---\n2: title: Vercel REST API Reference\n3: product: vercel\n4: url: /docs/rest-api\n5: canonical_url: \"https://vercel.com/docs/rest-api\"\n6: last_updated: 2026-11-23\n7: type: reference\n8: prerequisites:\n9: []\n10: related:\n11: - /docs/rest-api/access-groups/reads-an-access-group.md\n12: - /docs/rest-api/access-groups/update-an-access-group.md\n13: - /docs/rest-api/access-groups/deletes-an-access-group.md\n14: - /docs/rest-api/access-groups/list-members-of-an-access-group.md\n15: - /docs/rest-api/access-groups/list-access-groups-for-a-team-project-or-member.md\n16: summary: Interact programmatically with your Vercel account using the SDK or direct HTTP requests.\n17: install_vercel_plugin: npx plugins add vercel/vercel-plugin\n18: search_with_vercel_cli: npx vercel@latest docs search \"<query>\"\n19: ---\n20: # Vercel REST API Reference\n21: Vercel combines the best developer experience with an obsessive focus on end-user performance. Our platform enables frontend teams to do their best work.\n22: ## Access Groups\n23: | Method | Endpoint | Description |\n24: |---|---|---|\n25: | **GET** | [`/v1/access-groups/{idOrName}`](/docs/rest-api/access-groups/reads-an-access-group.md) | Reads an access group |\n26: | **POST** | [`/v1/access-groups/{idOrName}`](/docs/rest-api/access-groups/update-an-access-group.md) | Update an access group |\n27: | **DELETE** | [`/v1/access-groups/{idOrName}`](/docs/rest-api/access-groups/deletes-an-access-group.md) | Deletes an access group |\n28: | **GET** | [`/v1/access-groups/{idOrName}/members`](/docs/rest-api/access-groups/list-members-of-an-access-group.md) | List members of an access group |\n29: | **GET** | [`/v1/access-groups`](/docs/rest-api/access-groups/list-access-groups-for-a-team-project-or-member.md) | List access groups for a team, project or member |\n30: | **POST** | [`/v1/access-groups`](/docs/rest-api/access-groups/creates-an-access-group.md) | Creates an access group |\n31: | **GET** | [`/v1/access-groups/{idOrName}/projects`](/docs/rest-api/access-groups/list-projects-of-an-access-group.md) | List projects of an access group |\n32: | **POST** | [`/v1/access-groups/{accessGroupIdOrName}/projects`](/docs/rest-api/access-groups/create-an-access-group-project.md) | Create an access group project |\n33: | **GET** | [`/v1/access-groups/{accessGroupIdOrName}/projects/{projectId}`](/docs/rest-api/access-groups/reads-an-access-group-project.md) | Reads an access group project |\n34: | **PATCH** | [`/v1/access-groups/{accessGroupIdOrName}/projects/{projectId}`](/docs/rest-api/access-groups/update-an-access-group-project.md) | Update an access group project |\n35: | **DELETE** | [`/v1/access-groups/{accessGroupIdOrName}/projects/{projectId}`](/docs/rest-api/access-groups/delete-an-access-group-project.md) | Delete an access group project |\n36: ## Ai Gateway\n37: | Method | Endpoint | Description |\n38: |---|---|---|\n39: | **POST** | [`/ai-gateway/byok-credentials`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/create-a-byok-credential.md) | Create a BYOK credential |\n40: | **GET** | [`/ai-gateway/byok-credentials/list`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/list-byok-credentials.md) | List BYOK credentials |\n41: | **GET** | [`/ai-gateway/byok-credentials/{credentialId}`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/get-a-byok-credential.md) | Get a BYOK credential |\n42: | **PATCH** | [`/ai-gateway/byok-credentials/{credentialId}`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/update-a-byok-credential.md) | Update a BYOK credential |\n43: | **DELETE** | [`/ai-gateway/byok-credentials/{credentialId}`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/delete-a-byok-credential.md) | Delete a BYOK credential |\n44: | **GET** | [`/ai-gateway/virtual-model-configs`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/get-virtual-model-config.md) | Get virtual model config |\n45: | **POST** | [`/ai-gateway/virtual-model-configs`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/create-virtual-model-config.md) | Create virtual model config |\n46: | **PATCH** | [`/ai-gateway/virtual-model-configs`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/update-virtual-model-config.md) | Update virtual model config |\n47: | **DELETE** | [`/ai-gateway/virtual-model-configs`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/delete-virtual-model-config.md) | Delete virtual model config |\n48: | **GET** | [`/ai-gateway/virtual-model-configs/list`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/list-virtual-model-configs.md) | List virtual model configs |\n49: | **GET** | [`/ai-gateway/virtual-model-configs/{vmcSlug}`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/get-virtual-model-config-1.md) | Get virtual model config |\n50: | **PATCH** | [`/ai-gateway/virtual-model-configs/{vmcSlug}`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/update-virtual-model-config-1.md) | Update virtual model config |\n51: | **DELETE** | [`/ai-gateway/virtual-model-configs/{vmcSlug}`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/delete-virtual-model-config-1.md) | Delete virtual model config |\n52: | **GET** | [`/v1/ai-gateway/routers`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/list-ai-gateway-routers.md) | List AI Gateway routers |\n53: | **GET** | [`/ai-gateway/rules`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/list-rules.md) | List rules |\n54: | **POST** | [`/ai-gateway/rules`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/create-rule.md) | Create rule |\n55: | **PATCH** | [`/ai-gateway/rules`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/update-rule.md) | Update rule |\n56: | **DELETE** | [`/ai-gateway/rules`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/delete-rule.md) | Delete rule |\n57: | **GET** | [`/ai-gateway/budgets/list`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/list-ai-gateway-budgets.md) | List AI Gateway budgets |\n58: | **PUT** | [`/ai-gateway/budgets`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/upsert-ai-gateway-budget.md) | Upsert AI Gateway budget |\n59: | **DELETE** | [`/ai-gateway/budgets`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/archive-ai-gateway-budget.md) | Archive AI Gateway budget |\n60: | **GET** | [`/ai-gateway/budgets/defaults/list`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/list-ai-gateway-budget-defaults.md) | List AI Gateway budget defaults |\n61: | **PUT** | [`/ai-gateway/budgets/defaults`](/docs/rest-api/ai-gateway/upsert-ai-gateway