jobDefinitionId}/runs/{runAttempt}/logs`](/docs/rest-api/vercel-ci/get-log-lines-for-a-specific-job-run-attempt.md) | Get log lines for a specific job run attempt |\n593: | **GET** | [`/v1/vercel-ci/invocations/{invocationId}/attempts/{attempt}/job-definitions/{jobDefinitionId}/runs/{runAttempt}/task-definitions/{taskDefinitionId}/runs/{taskRunAttempt}/logs`](/docs/rest-api/vercel-ci/get-log-lines-for-a-specific-task-run-attempt.md) | Get log lines for a specific task run attempt |\n594: ## Web Analytics\n595: | Method | Endpoint | Description |\n596: |---|---|---|\n597: | **GET** | [`/v1/query/web-analytics/visits/aggregate`](/docs/rest-api/web-analytics/aggregates-page-views.md) | Aggregates page views |\n598: | **GET** | [`/v1/query/web-analytics/events/aggregate`](/docs/rest-api/web-analytics/aggregates-custom-events.md) | Aggregates custom events |\n599: | **GET** | [`/v1/query/web-analytics/visits/count`](/docs/rest-api/web-analytics/counts-page-views.md) | Counts page views |\n600: | **GET** | [`/v1/query/web-analytics/events/count`](/docs/rest-api/web-analytics/counts-custom-events.md) | Counts custom events |\n601: ## Webhooks\n602: | Method | Endpoint | Description |\n603: |---|---|---|\n604: | **GET** | [`/v1/webhooks`](/docs/rest-api/webhooks/get-a-list-of-webhooks.md) | Get a list of webhooks |\n605: | **POST** | [`/v1/webhooks`](/docs/rest-api/webhooks/creates-a-webhook.md) | Creates a webhook |\n606: | **GET** | [`/v1/webhooks/{id}`](/docs/rest-api/webhooks/get-a-webhook.md) | Get a webhook |\n607: | **DELETE** | [`/v1/webhooks/{id}`](/docs/rest-api/webhooks/deletes-a-webhook.md) | Deletes a webhook |\n608: ## Aliases\n609: | Method | Endpoint | Description |\n610: |---|---|---|\n611: | **GET** | [`/v2/deployments/{id}/aliases`](/docs/rest-api/aliases/list-deployment-aliases.md) | List Deployment Aliases |\n612: | **POST** | [`/v2/deployments/{id}/aliases`](/docs/rest-api/aliases/assign-an-alias.md) | Assign an Alias |\n613: | **GET** | [`/v4/aliases`