      "numbered_text": "1: Pricing & Fees | Supabase\n2: Skip to content\n3: Product\n4: Developers\n5: Solutions\n6: Pricing\n7: Docs\n8: Blog\n9: 115.3KSign inStart your project\n10: Main menu\n11: ProductDevelopersSolutionsPricingDocsBlog\n12: Product\n13: Database\n14: Fully portable Postgres database\n15: Authentication\n16: User Management out of the box\n17: Storage\n18: Serverless storage for any media\n19: Edge Functions\n20: Deploy code globally on the edge\n21: Compute\n22: Private Alpha\n23: Sandboxes and backend services\n24: Realtime\n25: Synchronize and broadcast events\n26: Modules\n27: Vector\n28: AI toolkit to manage embeddings\n29: Cron\n30: Schedule and manage recurring Jobs\n31: Queues\n32: Durable Message Queues with guaranteed delivery\n33: FeaturesExplore everything you can do with Supabase.\n34: Predictable pricing,\n35: designed to scale\n36: Start building for free, collaborate with your team, then scale to millions of users\n37: AI tools\n38: Ask ChatGPTAsk ClaudeCopy as Markdown\n39: Free\n40: Perfect for passion projects & simple websites.\n41: $0\n42: / month\n43: Start for Free\n44: Free projects are paused after 1 week of inactivity.\n45: Limit of 2 active projects.\n46: Get started with:\n47: Unlimited API requests\n48: 50,000 monthly active users\n49: 500 MB database size\n50: Shared CPU • 500 MB RAM\n51: 5 GB egress\n52: 5 GB cached egress\n53: 1 GB file storage\n54: Community support\n55: Pro\n56: Most Popular\n57: For production applications with the power to scale.\n58: From\n59: $25\n60: / month\n61: Get Started\n62: First project included.\n63: Additional from $10/mo.See how pricing scales\n64: Everything in the Free Plan, plus:\n65: 100,000 monthly active users\n66: then $0.00325 per MAU\n67: 8 GB disk size per project\n68: then $0.125 per GB\n69: 250 GB egress\n70: then $0.09 per GB\n71: 250 GB cached egress\n72: then $0.03 per GB\n73: 100 GB file storage\n74: then $0.0213 per GB\n75: Email support\n76: Daily backups stored