n220: Free Trial\n221: Explore the entire Datadog platform for 14 days.\n222: GET STARTED >\n223: Icon/logs-2\n224: Created with Sketch.\n225: Demo Session\n226: Sign up for a live product demonstration.\n227: ATTEND DEMO >\n228: Icon/logs-2\n229: Created with Sketch.\n230: Platform Datasheet\n231: Learn about Datadog features and capabilities.\n232: GET DATASHEET >\n233: Register for a demo session with a Datadog engineer\n234: ×\n235: I'd like Datadog to share the latest news about Datadog services and related offerings with me by email or telephone. You may unsubscribe at any time by following the instructions in the communications received from Datadog.\n236: Try out automated alerting that notifies you to critical issues\n237: Utilize your free trial to test out Datadog's alerting capabilities.\n238: Anomaly detection\n239: Detect when a metric's value deviates from its expected range, based on past trends.\n240: Outlier detection\n241: Find out when members of a group deviate significantly from their peers.\n242: Forecast alerts\n243: Find out when a metric is projected to cross a threshold.\n244: GET STARTED FREE\n245: Thousands of Customers Love & Trust the Datadog Platform\n246: Get the most out of your free trial\n247: Use these resources to guide your trial and learn modern monitoring best practices.\n248: Datadog Trial Starter Kit\n249: Datadog Documentation\n250: Monitoring Modern Infrastructure eBook\n251: Technology Integrations\n252: Best Practices Guide: Monitoring 101\n253: Monitoring 101: Collecting the right data\n254: Monitoring 101: Alerting on what matters\n255: Monitoring 101: Investigating performance issues\n256: Best Practices Guide: Alerting 101\n257: Alerting 101: Status checks\n258: Alerting 101: Timeseries metric checks\n259: Best Practices Guide: Metric graphs 101\n260: Metric graphs 101: Timeseries graphs\n261: Metric graphs 101: Summary graphs\n262: Metric graphs 101: Graphing anti-patterns\n263: Get 14 days of unlimited monitoring\